		stem: 'An auditor finds that the person running vulnerability triage has no relevant training, qualification or documented experience. Which requirement is most directly engaged?',
		options: ['Clause 7.2 Competence, because the organization cannot show the person is competent for work affecting security performance', 'Clause 7.3 Awareness, because the person is evidently not aware of their contribution to the effectiveness of the ISMS', 'A.6.1 Screening, because the background verification carried out before appointment was evidently inadequate', 'A.8.8 Management of technical vulnerabilities, because the triage activity itself is not being performed correctly'],
		correct_option: 'A',
		explanation: 'Clause 7.2 applies to persons doing work under the organization\'s control that affects information security performance, and requires competence to be determined and evidenced.',
