		stem: 'A sample of ten privileged accounts shows three belonging to people who left more than two months ago. How should an experienced auditor proceed before grading?',
		options: ['Widen the sample to establish whether the failure is isolated or systemic, since that determines minor against major', 'Grade it as a major nonconformity immediately, because any retained privileged access is by definition systemic', 'Grade it as a minor nonconformity, because only three of the ten accounts sampled were affected by the issue', 'Record it as an observation until the organization has had an opportunity to remove the accounts in question'],
		correct_option: 'A',
