		stem: 'An organization migrated its customer database to a new cloud provider nine months ago and has not revisited its risk assessment since. Which requirement is engaged?',
		options: ['Clause 8.2, because risk assessment must be performed when significant changes are proposed or occur', 'Clause 6.1.2, because the risk assessment method itself has evidently not been defined adequately', 'A.5.23, because the acquisition and use of the cloud service was not managed through a defined process', 'Clause 4.1, because the internal and external issues affecting the ISMS have not been reconsidered'],
		correct_option: 'A',
