		stem: 'The independent review of information security is carried out each year by the manager who designed and operates the ISMS. What is the correct conclusion?',
		options: ['A.5.35 is not met, because the review must be performed by a party independent of the area under review', 'A.5.35 is met, provided the review is documented and the results are reported to top management', 'The issue belongs under Clause 9.2 instead, because all ISMS reviews form part of the internal audit programme', 'The issue is an observation, because the standard encourages but does not require independence in this review'],
