		stem: 'An organization\'s stated security objective is "improve our security posture across the business". Why would an auditor challenge it?',
		options: ['It cannot be evaluated, and Clause 6.2 requires objectives to be measurable where practicable and monitored', 'It is too narrow in scope, because Clause 6.2 requires objectives to cover every applicable Annex A control', 'It has not been approved by top management, which Clause 5.1 requires for all information security objectives', 'It duplicates the information security policy, which Clause 5.2 already requires to express the same commitment'],
