		options: ['As a nonconformity, because the control is not applied consistently and the gap affects sensitive processing', 'As an observation, because a majority of the contracts sampled did contain the required security requirements', 'As a major nonconformity in every case, because any sampling failure demonstrates a systemic control breakdown', 'As no finding, because Annex A controls are guidance and only the management system clauses are auditable'],
