		options: ['Clause 4.2 is not met, because the relevant requirements of the interested parties have not been determined', 'Clause 4.2 is met, because the organization has identified the parties relevant to its management system', 'Clause 4.1 is not met, because the external issues affecting the ISMS have not been properly determined', 'Clause 7.4 is not met, because the organization has not planned how it communicates with those parties'],
		correct_option: 'A',
